  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio for the speed of the electron in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>rd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup></math> orbit of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;to the speed of the electron in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>rd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup></math> orbit of hydrogen atom will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The speed of electron is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>Z</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>&nbsp;is atomic number and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is number of orbit.</p><p>Now, for third orbit, ratio of speed of electron is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><msub><mi>Z</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}